This repository contains unofficial RPM packaging for Jitsi Meet on RHEL-family
Linux distributions. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by
8x8, Inc. or the Jitsi project.

The packaged software is built from upstream sources:

  - https://github.com/jitsi/jitsi-meet
  - https://github.com/jitsi/jitsi-videobridge
  - https://github.com/jitsi/jicofo
  - https://github.com/jitsi/jigasi
  - https://github.com/jitsi/jibri

